  "notable_quotes": [
    "In compounds 1-3, the Hatz ligand is generated by decarboxylation of 3-amino-1,2,4-triazole-5-carboxylic acid during solvothermal synthesis.",
    "Compounds 2-5 are all 3D frameworks but with distinct connectivities: 3,4-connected (2,3), 9-nodal (4), and 3,4,4-connected (5).",
    "Changing the carboxylate ligand skeleton strongly tunes MOF architecture and dimensionality, making it a tool for structure control."
